==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Hippowdon|69}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*'''Crashing Fangs''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Lycanroc V|91}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

